he
   Chancery Archives.
   2. Black and white photograph of the outdoor statue of the Blessed
   Virgin Mary, Church of the Nativity of the Blessed Virgin Mary, Hougang,
   Singapore, undated. Rev. Fr. Rene Nicolas Collection, courtesy of the
   Chancery Archives.
   3. Aerial shot of the Church of the Nativity of the Blessed Virgin Mary,
   Hougang, and its surrounding complex, undated. Rev. Fr. Rene Nicolas
   Collection, courtesy of the Chancery Archives.
   4. Black and white photograph of the Holy Innocents=E2=80=99 English Sch=
ool
   building facade, c. 1910s. Rev. Fr. Rene Nicolas Collection, courtesy of
   the Chancery Archives.
   5. Black and white photograph of the parish kampong houses of old
   Aukang, Teochew-Catholic Enclave, Singapore, c.1920s-1930s. Rev. Fr. Ren=
e
   Nicolas Collection, courtesy of the Chancery Archives.
   6. Black and white photograph of the =E2=80=98=E2=80=99kampong=E2=80=99=
=E2=80=99 parishioners of old
   Aukang, Teochew-Catholic Enclave, Singapore, c.1920s-1930s. Rev. Fr. Ren=
e
   Nicolas Collection, courtesy of the Chancery Archives.
   7. Working life in the kampong =E2=80=93 a young fisherman mending the p=
rawn
   trawler nets, c. 1930s. Maria Lee Ah Kin Collection, courtesy of the
   Chancery Archives.
   8. Kampong girls riding around the Ponggol 10th milestone neighbourhood,
   c. 1930s. Maria Lee Ah Kin Collection, courtesy of the Chancery Archives=
.
   9. The extended Chng Family comprising three generations of Aukang
   Teochew Catholics in front of an attap house, 1932. Maria Lee Ah Kin
   Collection, courtesy of the Chancery Archives.

Thank you and we wish you all the best in your Youtube channel and website.

